sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Child
  participant P as Parent, the web app
  participant A as API
  participant R as Runner
  participant M as Meta Muse
  P->>A: photo to S3, then the message
  A-)R: async poke
  R->>M: 1 step: photo, verbs
  M-->>R: lesson_draft, bank
  R->>R: lesson_check, in code
  R->>R: run events written
  P->>A: read the run's events
  A-->>P: a checked lesson
  P->>A: give the lesson
  A-->>P: the play link
  P->>C: shares the link
  C->>A: plays: start, answer
